                "questionEn": ":You are given a directed graph G=(V,E) with |V|=6 and the following edge set\n   <br>                    E = {(1,2),(2,3),(3,1),(3,4),(4,5),(5,4),(5,6)}\n\n <br> ?Which of the following statements about graph G is correct",
